yle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 소득분위 : 소득분위 7분위 이하(1 ~ 3순위)의 학생</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;: 장학재단에서 소득 심사함.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">2. 2학기 국가근로 신청일정(총 2회)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">정규학기 : 8. 1(수) ~ 8. 10(금)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 동계방학 : 11. 20(화) ~ 11. 30(금)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">3. 장학생 선발절차</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 학생 신청 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">2012. 8. 1(수) ~ 2012. 8. 10(금) </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">(09:00 ~ 18:00), 주말제외</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 한국장학재단 온라인(</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">www.kosaf.go.kr</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">)으로 신청 [붙임]</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 재단서류처리 및 소득확인 : 8. 17(금)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 장학생 선발 : 8월 말 (추후 공지예정)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 근로시작기간 : 9월</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">4. 신청절차[붙임]</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 한국장학재단 홈페이지(</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">www.kosaf.go.kr</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">) 회원가입 및 로그인</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;→ 장학금/장학금 전체보기 클릭</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;→ 국가근로장학금 내 신청하기 메뉴 클릭</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"> 온라인신청 후 서류는 제출기간 내에 한국장학재단으로 팩스(02-3419-8831) 송부</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">※ 자세한 신청절차는 [붙임] 참조</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">5. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">제출서류</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"> : 온라인신청을 완료한 학생은 다음과 같이 반드시 제출.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbs